{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_021330","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"装备盾牌的敌兵也很难缠。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"据说阿曼达是这么评价那些躲在盾牌后用手枪攻击的家伙的：“真的！　很让人火大。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":117,"review_flag":"AUX_EXPANDED_IDIOM_JPN_USED;SOURCE_FULLWIDTH_SPACE_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"尽量绕到他们侧面。用烟雾弹或眩晕手榴弹遮住他们的视线也不错。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":"AUX_SECOND_SENTENCE_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"另外，用穿甲弹应该能比较轻松地废掉盾牌。拿到穿甲弹后，要好好利用。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":99,"review_flag":"AUX_FINAL_INSTRUCTION_RESTORED"}]}